<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107253" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεράνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ</span>], Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>above,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκάτω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				588.31
			</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DDeor.</u>
					4.2
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <i>above the horizon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Euc.
				<u>Phaen.</u>
				p.8
			</span></i> M.: mostly c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τούτων [τῶν
				μορίων] σχίζεται [ἡ φλέψ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				513b32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				6.631.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				43.15
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. γίγνεσθαί τινος</span>
			to get <i>the upper hand of,</i> Teles<i><span class="en">
				p.44
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.10b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τεθεῖσθαι πάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Piet.</u>
					102
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖν</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖσθαί τινα</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ὑ. τινός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.98e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντων ὑ. ποιεῖν</span> act
				<i>more nobly</i> than all others, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				7.128
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ὑ. πλεονασμοί</span>
			<i>excessive</i> repetitions, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.24.1
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίαν ὑ. ποιότητα</span> one
				<i>supreme</i> quality, <i><span class="en">
				Meno
				<u>Iatr.</u>
				14.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of time,
				<i>further back,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν ὑ. χρόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					742.58
				</span></i>
			 (Ephesus, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>above,</i> in a document, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηφίσματα]
				ὑ. γεγραμμένα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				591.2
			</span></i> (Lampsacus, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
